  "slug": "political-and-media-literacy",
  "title": "Political and Media Literacy - Cross Party Group",
  "purpose": "The Cross-Party Group would provide a forum for Senedd Members to explore how political and media literacy can be strengthened across Wales, working cross-party to identify shared priorities and develop practical recommendations. Initial areas of focus are likely to include: How political and media literacy can be more consistently embedded across the Curriculum for Wales The impact of mis- and disinformation on democratic participation in Wales How the Senedd can better support an informed electorate, particularly given the new voting system and expanded franchise The training and resource needs of educators and youth workers delivering this work Ensuring any recommendations are bilingual and reach Wales' diverse communities The group would not seek to dictate specific outcomes in advance, but rather to examine the evidence, hear from experts and stakeholders, and build cross-party consensus on what action is needed.",
